+/*
+ * Titan Pocket torch LED on the MT6370 FLED channels (pocket_torch.c). The camera
+ * flashlight (flashlights-mt6370) claims the channels before it lights them, which
+ * turns a pocket_torch light off, and pocket_torch refuses to light while it holds
+ * them. It releases them once both channels are off.
